ority=\"51\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 5\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 5\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"46\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 1 Light Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"47\" Name=\"List Table 2 Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\"\r\n   Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 6\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" SemiHidden=\"true\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"\r\n   Name=\"Mention\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" SemiHidden=\"true\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"\r\n   Name=\"Smart Hyperlink\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" SemiHidden=\"true\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"\r\n   Name=\"Hashtag\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" SemiHidden=\"true\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"\r\n   Name=\"Unresolved Mention\"/>\r\n  <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" SemiHidden=\"true\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"\r\n   Name=\"Smart Link\"/>\r\n </w:LatentStyles>\r\n</xml><![endif]--><!-- [if gte mso 10]>\r\n<style>\r\n /* Style Definitions */\r\n table.MsoNormalTable\r\n	{mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\";\r\n	mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0;\r\n	mso-tstyle-colband-size:0;\r\n	mso-style-noshow:yes;\r\n	mso-style-priority:99;\r\n	mso-style-parent:\"\";\r\n	mso-padding-alt:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-top:0in;\r\n	mso-para-margin-right:0in;\r\n	mso-para-margin-bottom:8.0pt;\r\n	mso-para-margin-left:0in;\r\n	line-height:107%;\r\n	mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\n	font-size:11.0pt;\r\n	font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif;\r\n	mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\n	mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\n	mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\";\r\n	mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;}\r\n</style>\r\n<![endif]--></p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '171120-081130_60864030c934e.jpg', 'i6.jpg', 1, '2021-04-25 22:23:12', '2021-06-03 03:08:03');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `action_user`, `blog_categories_id`, `blog_title`, `blog_slug`, `blog_des`, `meta_des`, `meta_tags`, `meta_keys`, `thumbnailOne`, `thumbnailTwo`, `isPublished`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(7, 1, 5, 'Tired Of Scoring Low On IELTS Or TOEFL? Take PTE Test And Get Your Desired Score!', 'tired-of-scoring-low-on-ielts-or-toefl-take-pte-test-and-get-your-desired-score', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">If an individual is struggling to score higher bands like 7 or 8 in IELTS, PTE might be worth trying. Albeit, not so popular test compared to that of IELTS and TOEFL, PTE has its own values adding up to industry standards proficiency. PTE is Pearson Tests of English which is widely accepted on global platforms by many organizations, institutions, and colleges as an alternative to IELTS or TOEFL. Moreover, if one is narrowing down to Australia, it is highly efficient as it is approved by the Australian&nbsp;Department of immigration&nbsp;for migration or study abroad purposes. It is fully computer-based, so the test is conducted online and the results are delivered within 48 hours from the test-taking dates.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">For a deeper comprehension of PTE, one needs to get acquainted with its test format. This article covers 4 main sections of the PTE test. All of the tasks test specific linguistic or language skills that are not arbitrarily created. One needs to know how to approach individual tasks. Similar to that of IELTS or TOEFL exams, it also comprises four sections:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Speaking:</strong> The speaking sections comprises the first task which is the Read aloud task, which involves a paragraph on the screen and individuals get 30 to 40 seconds to prepare to read the same paragraph of text out loud while the screen turns into a recorder. One needs to read aloud as clearly as they can maximizing indentation, poising connected speech, and chunking all these wonderful elements of fluency. One should avoid reading like a robot. For the second task, one hears a single sentence which they need to memorize and have to exactly say the sentence using the same indentation and rhythm. The third task is to Describe the image, which might be a bit challenging for many as the student needs to analyse the given image which can either be a pie chart, bar chart, line graph, or an image within 25 seconds then they need to describe the image in their own words spontaneously with fluency and coherent and without too many hesitations. For the fourth task, individuals see an image and will also hear a recording for 60 to 90 seconds, and while listening to the lecture the test taker needs to take notes on the provided plastic erasable booklet. Then s/he gets 10 seconds heads-up and then they need to retell the story in their own words. The final task is to answer short questions whereby students will be asked to give a kind of noun or verb which tests the candidate&rsquo;s deep understanding of vocabulary which can sometimes be tricky to understand.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Writing:</strong> The writing&nbsp;section&nbsp;comprises 2 tasks. The first task is summarizing the written text where students are provided with a paragraph of written text up to 300 words and students need to summarize it to a single complex sentence which reflects the main idea of the paragraph within the timeframe of 10 minutes.&nbsp; It contributes to both the reading and writing scores of an individual. In task 2 one needs to write an essay on a given topic and it should be between 200 - 300 words neither more nor less than that range. The essay structure is an important part where the candidate needs to put emphasis. It comprises an introduction, paragraph 1, paragraph 2, and conclusion.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Reading:</strong> The reading section comprises patterns of questions like, fill in the blanks where the candidate gets a paragraph of text and there are dropdowns that have four possible options. So, from the context of the text, the candidate needs to choose the right word and there might be synonyms of the words closest to the meaning rather than the exact words. Out of the given options, only one is the correct answer. It tests the individual&rsquo;s precise word choice to choose the right word which makes more sense. It contributes to both the reading and writing scores. Next is Multiple choice: choose multiple answers where candidates get a passage and will have to provide more than one answer to the given question. The candidate must be careful while answering as it involves negative marking. If an individual provides one correct answer and another wrong answer then&nbsp; s/he scores no points. Thereby it is mandatory that both the answers are correct. But, if the candidate answers at least one correct answer then s/he can get the points. In the reading section, the tasks are not divided in terms of timing, so the candidate needs to manage their time and move efficiently, accurately through the tasks. So, one can linger for a longer time in a particular task. Next is the Reading Reorder paragraph, On the left-hand side candidate gets single sentences placed in the wrong order, so on the right-hand side the candidate needs to arrange in the correct order so that the paragraph flows coherently and cohesively from start to finish. The final task is also to fill in the blanks, which is a relatively short text compared to the previous fill in blanks tasks. The paragraph is about 80 words long and the options are provided in boxes, the candidate needs to drag and drop the right word into the right gap. It tests the collocation to know the candidate&rsquo;s ability to use natural-sounding phrases. The final task is multiple-choice choose a single answer. Candidates get a paragraph containing some text and a question related to that text. Each question has 4 options and the candidate needs to choose a single option. It might ask the candidate to find the opinion of the author or the attitudes of the author or the main idea of the paragraph or might be a specific detail. That means it might have a range of functions critical to an individual&rsquo;s understanding.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>Listening:</strong> The listening sections comprises patterns of tasks where the student needs to summarize the spoken text in their own words without grammatical errors in the given box. The text will be played between 60 - 90 seconds. Then the candidate gets 10 minutes to summarize the spoken text. Succeeding this is multiple-choice questions, multiple answers, where the candidate hears text for 60 - 90 seconds, and a question prompt displays that the candidate needs to pick from the provided sets of options either one or multiple options. It is safe to pick one correct answer as in this there is negative marking for incorrect answers. Next is, fill in the blanks, where the candidate hears a lecture, there is a paragraph of texts with gaps in between which needs to be filled with appropriate words that best fits. These gaps have to be filled with words consisting of nouns, verbs, adjectives &amp; adverbs. Rarely the gaps comprise prepositions and articles. The words need to be correctly spelled. After this is highlight the correct summary, whereby candidates either get audio or a video. The candidate needs to take notes from the audio or video as the options are very long texts and it becomes impossible for candidates to read and listen to the texts simultaneously. Following this is the select missing word where the candidate hears short audio for 30 seconds. The candidates hear the texts but in the end, they can hear a beep sound and they need to guess what the audio was about to say and would have to select the word from the given options. Succeeding this is, multiple-choice choose a single answer, where the candidate hears a lecture for 90 seconds and a question displays that have multiple options, the candidate needs to select only a single answer from there. Upcoming is highlight incorrect words, a lecture of 60 - 90 second plays and there is a paragraph of texts which is exactly the same text spoken in the recording, the candidate just needs to click those words which are not similar to that of spoken texts and the text turns yellow. If sometimes the candidate presses incorrect words, they can click the same word again to unhighlight it. Finally, the last task is to write from dictations, this task contributes to both the listening and writing score, thereby, it is important to listen to the given audio which is a single text, and write exactly the same text into the given box.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">If an individual is going through a hard time getting the required score in PTE then they can surely contact ITEC. ITEC (International Training &amp; Education Counsel) is the most trusted education agent in the context of Bangladesh putting forward&nbsp; PTE services for individuals interested in taking this course. The courses are provided face to face with practise sessions to improve their overall performance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '061220-091203_608649b5e743d.jpg', 'i7.jpg', 1, '2021-04-25 23:03:49', '2021-04-25 23:03:49'),
(8, 1, 6, 'Want To Study Abroad? Why Not Choose Australia. Know Why!', 'want-to-study-abroad-why-not-choose-australia-know-why', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">When it comes to getting abroad study options one cannot deny the fact that Australia is one of the dream countries for international students. The country is popular around the globe because of its high living standards, creativity, innovation, diversity, and culture. Besides, a significant number of individuals concentrate to abroad study in western countries, for example, the UK and the USA. Choosing where to concentrate abroad can be a concerning decision. Also, if one needs to be living in a less thickly populated island, surrounded by seashores, or profoundly populated urban areas, at that point, Australia may be an excellent choice. Presenting some of the finest reasons to choose Australia as an&nbsp;abroad study&nbsp;destination.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Outstanding Education System:&nbsp;There\'s no doubt that Australia has one of the best education systems in the world. The country possesses group 8 universities which rank among the top 50 universities of the world. As per 2017 reports, more than 80,000 students from worldwide chose Australia as their study destination. The marking system is quite different from elsewhere. HD, D, C, P, and F for High Distinction, Distinction, Credit, Pass and Fail respectively.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Easily Accessibility to a Student Visa:</strong>&nbsp;When it comes to accessing a visa, the procedure is almost similar to all other countries, but the success rate is higher in terms of Australian visa. The requisites are a confirmation letter from the university that the student has enrolled in, the proof of the student\'s financial documents which includes the cost of study, accommodation, and departure. It is also mandatory to provide a certificate that proves the student\'s command of English if they belong to non-English speaking countries. Lastly, health and liability insurances.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Cost of Living:&nbsp;</strong>Although, Australia&rsquo;s standard of living is highest out of other countries in the world. The cost of living, tuition fees are comparatively lower in Australia than in the United States and the United Kingdom. Indeed, International students are permitted to work part-time while they study, allowing them to earn for their living costs. There is also the opportunity for scholarships, which helps to decrease the cost of studying for international students.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Technological reach:</strong>&nbsp;One of the most captivating features of Australia for international students is the emphasis on scientific research. Australia is at the frontline of the latest technology and innovations. Students who study in Australia can take benefit from the country&rsquo;s admirable technology and resources.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Global Recognition:</strong>&nbsp;Graduates from Australian schools are highly valued due to the impressive international reputation of the Australian education system. This system is meticulously governed by the government in order to maintain the high standards of education associated with the country.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Diversity of Education:</strong>&nbsp;Colleges and Universities in Australia provide numerous courses and degrees in various fields, so international students can without any hindrance look for schools and fields of study that right fits them. The first-choice international student needs to make when picking a degree program in which school offers most to their demands and interests. Students have the option to choose between universities, vocational education, and&nbsp;English<a href=\"https://www.itecounsel.com/blogs/tired-of-scoring-low-on-ielts-or-toefl-take-pte-test-and-get-your-desired-score-1\">&nbsp;</a>language&nbsp;training. If required, it is a straightforward process for students to move between one qualification level and from one institution to another.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Work Opportunity:</strong>&nbsp;While studying in Australia, per week, international students can work up to 20 hours. It is a noteworthy chance for those who want to earn money to earn living expenses during their stay, and for students who want to gain work experience in their field of interest while they study.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Before enrolling, in the Study abroad program, individuals must consider the above-mentioned reasons and seek the help of a trusted agency to guide them neatly. In the context of Bangladesh, out of numerous agencies, ITEC is a trusted agency that caters to study in Australia support for Bangladeshi students. It offers to help students from the initial stage for the successful completion of their journey to Australia. So, if an individual is interested to study in Australia, they must contact ITEC because ITEC lives up to students&rsquo; expectations.&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '061220-071250_60864b5021a2b.jpg', 'i8.jpg', 1, '2021-04-25 23:10:40', '2021-04-25 23:10:40'),
(9, 1, 7, 'If You Want To Attain A Brighter Future, Migrate To A New Destination!', 'if-you-want-to-attain-a-brighter-future-migrate-to-a-new-destination', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Migration is constantly taking place around the world. Be it immigration or emigration, an internal migration, or external migration, people are moving from one place to another time and again. In generic terms, the movement of people from one place to another in search of a better lifestyle either for settling permanently or temporarily at a new place is called Migration.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">When an individual or group of people move within a state, country, or continent, it is called Internal migration whereas moving to a different state, country, or continent is called external migration.&nbsp; Similarly, leaving one country to move to another is known as emigration, and moving into a new country is immigration.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">There are several factors that propel migration. In this article, two of the most asked questions related to migration are explained in detail.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Why is migration rising?</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px; text-align: justify;\">It is inevitable that the refugees make up only about a 10th of the migrant population, while conflicts and instability have increased the number of people forced to leave their own homelands. Work is the primary reason because of which people move to another country, and the decreased cost of travel has made it easier to do so. So has the online boom, enabling voyagers to know more about their destinations and get in touch to home once they&rsquo;ve arrived. Opportunities to study abroad have expanded significantly. Indeed, climate change and the shortages of water, bad harvests, and rise in sea level it&rsquo;s causing are expected to push more people from their homes in the future.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Are migrants a burden?</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px; text-align: justify;\">Economists say that migration can benefit economies. Studies exhibit that the social services migrants use are largely paid for by their tax contributions. By including (mostly younger) workers, migration can increase gross domestic product and ease pressure on pension systems. Still, the large arrival of people sometimes stresses schools, health care systems, and markets. Some analyses have found that an increase in newcomers affects the native wages, causing them to depreciate, though the effects were trivial. Immigration critics often bring into limelight specific crimes committed by new arrivals, but research challenges the notion that migration leads to more lawlessness. In the U.S., a number of studies have summarized that migrants commit crimes at lower rates than native-born Americans. In Germany, crime fell 10% amid an influx of migrants.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Migration affects both places, positively as well as negatively so there is an emergence of expert consultations to carry out the whole migration process smoothly without any hiccups.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In the context of Bangladesh, there are numerous agencies that are providing migration services. International Training &amp; Education Counsel (ITEC) is one of the top-rated agencies in Bangladesh which comprises highly trained and professional consultants to help the people who want to move to a foreign land for settling permanently with step by step guidance throughout the migration process. ITEC is affiliated with numerous attorneys currently practicing in the states of Australia, Canada, and Europe ready to make the migrational arrangements for anyone planning to settle abroad. As an internationally recognized agency, ITEC has always maintained complete transparency throughout the whole process.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">If an individual is willing to migrate to another place in search of a better lifestyle the first step will be to fill up the necessary details on the website to check their eligibility. It is test time now to find out whether or not the skills that an individual has acquired is of any use in the foreign lands.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '140221-030253_60864c3961870.jpg', 'i9.jpg', 1, '2021-04-25 23:14:33', '2021-04-25 23:14:33'),
(10, 1, 8, 'Want To Know The Top Reasons To Choose Canada As Study Destination?', 'want-to-know-the-top-reasons-to-choose-canada-as-study-destination', '<p>When it comes to the study abroad program, most people choose the US, Australia, Europe as study destinations. But, due to the growing number of students planning to study abroad, getting a student admission has not become easy for many. Presenting some of the finest reasons to choose Canada as a study destination.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Academic excellence:</strong>\r\n<p>One of the most significant reasons why students choose to study in Canada is because of the high quality of education. When a student obtains a degree from a Canadian university, it acts as a mark of reliability and greatness. 26 of Canada\'s universities rank in the QS World University Rankings 2019 and 27 of them in The World University Rankings 2019.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Ample research opportunities</strong>:\r\n<p>One of the major reasons why Canadian education stands unique is because of its solid focus on research and development. If an individual is a research scholar, there can be no country better than Canada. The government of Canada provides huge support to research in the numerous field of studies, such as medicine, telecommunication, agriculture, environmental science, and technology.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Affordable falls in the budget:</strong>\r\n<p>Tuition fee in Canada, in comparison with other universities in the US and UK, is fairly cheaper. And when considering the return on investment, it is quite a feasible option for South-Asian students? An individual can also apply to a range of scholarships to cut down on their educational expenses.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Cultural diversity:</strong>\r\n<p>In Canada, one can find very warm and welcoming people who come from different ethnic groups with different cultures and lifestyles. The multicultural environment in Canada develops friendliness and peaceful living like no other country. In fact, one will find a lot of Asian origins studying, working, and living here. One can also experience festivals and rituals such as:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<div>The Montreal International Jazz Festival</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<div>Calgary Stampede</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<div>NHL Hockey</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<div>Experience &ldquo;Poutine Week&rdquo; &ndash; The mix of French fries, delicious gravy, and cheese curd.</div>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<div>Just for Laughs Comedy Festival in Montreal</div>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p><strong>Safe and peaceful:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Canada has been constantly ranked as one of the secured nations in the world. In 2018, the Global Peace Index* listed Canada as the sixth conflict-free country across the globe. As an international student, one will enjoy the same rights as any other Canadian.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Earn while one learns:</strong>\r\n<p>The special regulations in Canada, provide opportunities to all its international students to work for up to 20 hours every week during their semesters and full-time during the summer and winter vacations. To work on-campus or as an intern in any company, an individual would not require any additional work permit as their study permit is enough to help them find a part-time job.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Vibrant and lively campus life:</strong>\r\n<p>At all Canadian campuses, one can expect events, fests, and other activities being conducted all through the year. This creates a happy and lively environment for all the students, helps to network and meet new people besides keeping the homesickness away.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p><strong>Immigration opportunities:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Canada&rsquo;s Post-Graduation Work Permit Program (PWPP) permits students to stay and work in Canada for up to three years after completion of their graduation. An individual can gain some international work experience and apply for permanent residency later on.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>When individuals are fully convinced of a study abroad program, they can apply through a trusted agent who will help them for their study abroad journey. In the context of Bangladesh, out of numerous agencies, ITEC is a trusted agency that caters to study in Canada support for Bangladeshi students. It offers to help students from the initial stage for the successful completion of their journey to Canada. So, if an individual is interested to study in Canada, they must contact ITEC because ITEC lives up to students&rsquo; expectations.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '250221-090219_60864d174e356.jpg', 'i10.jpg', 1, '2021-04-25 23:18:15', '2021-04-25 23:18:15'),
(11, 1, 9, 'Want To Earn Foreign Degree Post COVID-19? Know, How To Plan Wisely!', 'want-to-earn-foreign-degree-post-covid-19-know-how-to-plan-wisely', '<p>Abroad Studies is the first preference for people looking to get a quality education and those who can actually bear all the costs to get an overseas qualification. It has been a trend among students as well as for their families to get a foreign degree so that they can maintain a good image in society. But, since the covid 19 breakthroughs, it has become difficult for people to opt for abroad studies. Many lives have been affected during the COVID-19 situations which have impacted hugely in terms of Studying Abroad. Australia, Europe, UK, Canada, and Malaysia have always been the favorite destinations for most students. But, lately, due to COVID-19 most people are now concerned about the hassle one needs to go through if they want to study abroad. Complete medical health checkups, medical history of the individuals are some of the things to name. Thereby most people prefer not to dive into such circumstances. The effect of COVID-19 on international students has been discussed below:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>The Effect of COVID-19 on International Students!</h2>\r\n<p>Global higher education is currently facing unprecedented drawbacks due to the crisis, which has led students to change their study plans, at every level of studies.</p>\r\n<p>On average, the pandemic has affected more than 50% of study abroad aspirants and there is no doubt that the movement of students has been tremendously affected. Many universities have decided to suspend all mass lectures for the next academic year, restrict the number of students for classroom learning, and carry out online classes. Moreover, Universities including Oxford and Cambridge have informed students that they can start the academic year after going through quarantine and by following the public health norms.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>Plan On Studying Overseas Post COVID-19</h2>\r\n<p>Below are some of the tips for study abroad aspirants to address the COVID-19 challenges:</p>\r\n<p>Stick to the plan:&nbsp;No one can predict the end of this pandemic or when everything will fall back to place. However, it certainly is wise for students to continue with the application process and stick to their current plan. It is known that many foreign universities have extended their application deadline for international students, giving them enough time to decide on whether studying abroad now is the most viable option for them or not. This way, students will not have a gap year and attend classes online in the initial stage and later be permitted to take classes on campus.</p>\r\n<p>Explore universities with great COVID-19 response:&nbsp;Almost all universities have adopted preventive measures to adapt to these unusual conditions. The measures may vary from country to country and there might be a slight difference in the conducting approach. Many universities overseas have even reduced their tuition fees in response to the outbreak of the novel coronavirus.</p>\r\n<p>Focus on Preparation:&nbsp;With students restricted to their homes, it is a convenient time to prepare for entrance tests accepted by the various foreign universities. All exam conducting bodies such as the College Board, Graduate Management Admission Council, and so on. have introduced a remote proctoring solution to permit students to take tests like GMAT, SAT, ACT from the comfort of their homes.</p>\r\n<p>Defer admissions by a year:&nbsp;Students can choose to drop a year and attend when the time is as usual again. It will not have any negative impact on their studies. Studying online might help deal with the financial crisis but it might also take away the opportunity of experiencing a completely different way of life on an international campus. So, deferring admission could be a rather wise decision.</p>\r\n<p>Things prospective international students shall be looking for while applying to foreign universities are as follows:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Changes to the application process</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Changes to application deadlines</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Availability of seats in the preferred course at a university</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Changes to the dates of any entrance exams</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Changes to the course structure</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Restrictions for universities to prepare unconditional offers</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Measures the university has implemented to reduce the spread of the coronavirus on campus</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Changes to English language test requirements</li>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">How to defer application (if required)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>Foreign Universities Responses to the COVID-19 Pandemic</h2>\r\n<p>Apart from moving to virtual/online classes and abiding by government guidelines on COVID-19, universities all around the world have adopted various measures to draw the attention of more international students and meet their needs:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Under the new admission criteria, many universities and colleges are permitting students without GRE or GMAT scores.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">There is a reduction in fee structure at various universities, permitting more international students to opt for higher education abroad despite COVID-19. Australia is offering fee-waivers and financial aid to aspirants looking for admission to institutions in the country.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Along with counselling, scholarships, and special discounts for international students, various universities in the United Kingdom are accepting online copies of degree certificates as producing the original copies could be a difficult task now.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Universities in the UK are restructuring their course curricula and exploring ways to offer courses in a blended format and ensure smooth conduct of education.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Alternatives to traditional teaching such as pre-recorded lectures, video calls, online assignments, online and open book exams are being put into practice.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li aria-level=\"1\">Keeping in mind the travel restrictions due to the pandemic, universities have initiated offering virtual tours to students and their parents. They are given a complete draft of university facilities, the admission needs, various academic programs, and methods to initiate the application process during or after the COVID-19 crisis.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If an individual is interested to study abroad post the covid -19 situation, either in Australia, UK, Europe, Canada, or Malaysia, they can apply through a trusted agent who will help them for their study abroad journey. In the context of Bangladesh, out of numerous agencies, ITEC is a trusted agency that caters to study abroad support for Bangladeshi students. It offers to help students from the very beginning until the end for their complete successful process. ITEC has set a benchmark in the student counselling sector. So, if an individual is interested to study abroad, they should wait no longer to get associated with ITEC for a thorough stepwise study abroad application process and start their journey for a better future, ABROAD!</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '080321-040317_60864dd85ae00.jpg', 'i11.jpg', 1, '2021-04-25 23:21:28', '2021-04-25 23:21:28'),
(12, 2, 4, 'The Best 10 Ways RPL Can Shape Your Future In Australia', 'the-best-10-ways-rpl-can-shape-your-future-in-australia', '<h1>Build a safe and secure career in Australia with RPL certificates</h1>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Imagine a phase of your career in Australia with all the facilities you are dreaming of. Well, it is possible for you to get an easy-going career in Australia if you have such talents.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Now, you might be getting difficulties as you don&rsquo;t have any qualified degree or experienced certificates. Then don&rsquo;t get upset too soon, by getting an RPL (Recognition of prior learning) diploma course training on your required skill will help you to get a job that you perfectly fit in. Here, we are presenting 10 possible ways to shape your future in Australia through RPL training programs.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2>10 Best Ways on How RPL helps with jobs and career development in Australia</h2>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p>RPL diploma courses on basic skills which are offered by Australia qualifications Institution to improve your qualifications in business administration, accounting (bookkeeping), managements, sales-marketing, and other lots of professional sectors. To be recognized in your passionate job and those RPL courses will lead you to get a better future in the job sector. Now you just have to decide in which part you want to move in, and will it be a good choice for you to make a career in Australia?</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">From the current pandemic situation of Covid-19, it is a great opportunity for you to have an online study of RPL courses from home and get organizational certificates without leaving your spot. Now think and get started to complete an RPL degree available in various categories and earn a professional certificate of your interest. Nowadays, many organizations are offering some free trials of RPL classes to let you know of your interests. So, at least try one of our best RPL courses for beauty therapy or remedial massage on trial.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">You can spot yourself in some advanced diploma course without doing all the basic or preliminary courses. There are some advantages of doing an advanced RPL course to extend your career more sharply and the proficiencies are higher than doing a normal course in the career race. Now in Australia, you will find out that everyone is more careful with their job line and they always upgrade their job efficiency by professionally doing such RPL courses.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">No worries if you have broader talents or mostly you are qualified for any suitable job regarding your current qualification. Then getting RPL Certificates III will be a nice and easy choice without having the hard study of diploma courses. Just send your working portfolio or videos, or any other suitable paperwork for qualification quarry to get an RPL certified certificate. With the certificate of your own, it will help you to apply for a job in Australia.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">There are plenty of options to boost up or get the rage in your career by earning one of the Certificates IV from your past working ability. This certificate is also part of Recognition of prior learning (RPL) diploma training in Australia. The RPL certification process is very easy to adopt and it is a comfortable apprenticeship path for an Australian to start a career. First, pass the free skill assessment test from the educational counsel representative, then provide a working portfolio for checking, and lastly, get qualified for the certificates.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Build a business career through RPL in Australia. It will reduce the job risk and helps to boost your working confidence in living life as an Australian. Though it&rsquo;s not easy to maintain a business profession up there. But think getting the skill through RPL will emerge your working spirit and rage your capacity to grow your business. Through the RPL process, you will get to know more info about business core and lots of working methods for an outstanding result.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">If you are pretty good in the technology sector and have well-enough information to maintain the automobile sector then a career in Australia is going to be an easy platform for you. It&rsquo;s like you can jump into any related job on the technology side with just a little effort. Also, with the help of an RPL certificate, you can have more steps ahead in this job context than the other. So, the possibilities of making a career in the IT and automotive industries are very high through RPL services.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Are you eligible for getting RPL in Australia? Best RPL degrees in Australia are providing by ITEC-Australia at a low cost. For an international student, an easier way to make money is to engage in a job from their previous working experience then do some RPL courses for more support in the job sector. As we know, the living expenses and to afford a better life in Australia is very high and it is important to start a career without being idle. So, kick your career with an RPL certificate for a long journey in Australia.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">One of the best parts of joining in Recognition of prior learning (RPL) program is achieving a lifetime required working license after completing your training. Easily you can make the connection with the relevant industries. Like, RPL hospitality management and commercial cookery assessment who are really interested in that. Thus, anyone can just grab this golden opportunity with the completion of an RPL degree and construct a better life in Australia, not as a jobless fellow. Moreover, an RPL certificate will always help you with immigration and visa requirement issues in Australia.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Saving time and money is the greatest fact for living in Australia. By allowing yourself in career improvement or avoiding the repetition of previous training will be a smart thought. Here, the RPL valuation degree will lead you continued to grow the professional development inside your talented capability. You can have a relaxed time by not running after finding the required job or if you are talented then there will be no need to engage in an extra study on academic courses.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">It will help you to reduce both your institutional and professional training cost too.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Last words,</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">To start up your dynamic career, there are several free and paid RPL courses are available to offer by &ldquo;ITEC- Australia\".</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This is one of the best career counseling centers in Australia. Choose your best RPL program from any of the suitable courses that you need to grow up your career line and develop your skill into that. Go through the RPL section to know more about our advanced level and certified courses. Before you click into the Recognition of prior learning (RPL) component don&rsquo;t forget to read this article about &lsquo;How to get RPL certificates&rdquo;.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, '190421-050454_60864f1abfe19.jpg', 'i12.jpg', 1, '2021-04-25 23:26:50', '2021-04-25 23:26:50'),
(13, 1, 6, 'Top 10 Well-Paid Engineering Job Sectors in Australia', 'top-10-well-paid-engineering-job-sectors-in-australia', '<p>Well! You achieved a degree from an engineering university, or you got an RPL certificate in the Engineer industry. Now, you might be concerned about the jobs and your career. If you want to make the growth in your career, the first thing you need to know what type of vacancies are available in the Australian job markets. For a primary level job in this industry, has various opportunities for the freshers who have graduated recently from an engineering college? Moreover, there have lots of potential job sectors in the engineering industry.</p>\r\n<p>In general, most jobs in the engineering department require experienced and skilled candidates. Based on skills, the engineering job sectors are categorized. From the bottom line to the upper level, every engineering employment has an expected salary range. Some companies may even offer much more remuneration than your idea in this industry. Those are some specific positions that are not available to get hired without having years of experience. Thinking of all those engineering job areas has different promising pay and committed job security in Australia.</p>\r\n<p>Here we will talk about some well-paid engineering jobs that have high demands in the Australian job professions.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Mine Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> The mining engineers are assigned to do technical support in the mining operations. Their main job involves mining construction projects for project supply procurements calculation, an anthology of mining ground, selection of mining tools and machinery, etc. Before any mining project starts, Mining engineers estimate all the relevant capital and equipment of mining operations. They also record the informative report of supplies and reserves of capital. In the field, they are the priority supervisors to maintain trouble issues, improve productivity and control the cost efficiency in the mine set.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 85,000 (Initially) to AUD 170,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n<li><strong>Petroleum Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> Petroleum Engineers are allocated for various retrieving oil and natural gas projects from beneath the earth\'s surface. Most petroleum engineers get the charge in oil retrieving companies, and the rest have the opportunities in the research Center or the universities as associate lecturers. Some engineers work in the field gesture and help to prospect terms of cost, human resources, work equipment on drilling/pumping sites. Others have tasks in construction operations to look after the outcome and create reports based on the overall site state.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 78,000 (Initially) to AUD 180,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"3\">\r\n<li><strong>Nuclear Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> Nuclear engineers are responsible for developing the analysis processes for the nuclear energy and radiation development projects. They do research, design atomic energy system, and oversee equipment development, testing, and reactor maintenance. In addition, nuclear engineers are in the assessment part of nuclear technical performance, monitor the core application, nuclear experiment, and the optimizations of new methodologies by expertise.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 67,000 (Initially) to AUD 120,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"4\">\r\n<li><strong>Biomedical Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> Biomedical engineers play supportive roles in medical research and bioproducts. The primary job is to work as a team in the relevant field of study in chemistry. In addition, they have to work in different sub-fields tasks in the experimental practices, monitoring jobs, communicating with technical engineers, etc. Most experienced and skilled biomedical engineers engage in robotic surgery operations and other required medicine sections.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 50,000 (Initially) to AUD 90,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"5\">\r\n<li>Aeronautical Engineer</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> Aeronautical engineers usually work for the government defence ministry. For any specific security clearance, an aeronautical engineer needs special access, which the government provides. They mainly work on aerospace design and oversee aircraft, missiles, and satellite development. They also maintain confidential projects, others security, and functional tasks and assign for any prototype test.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 62,000 (Initially) to AUD 115,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"6\">\r\n<li><strong>Industrial Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> Most industrial engineers serve in the manufacturing and environmental industries. Industrial engineers are hired to utilize the lower line workers for any manufacturing development process, improving machinery and other resources operation in proper analysis. They need to adopt various strategies to make more efficient production and create new forms of components to work in their proficiency.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 47,000 (Initially) to AUD 105,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"7\">\r\n<li><strong>Quantity Surveyor Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> A quantity surveyor engineer handle multitasks on different clients and the production sector as a quality controller. They consider construction and engineering cost consultants for different clients. From the position of a quantity surveyor, they are referred for project manager in a big manufacturing company for quality and quantity assurance.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 57,000 (Initially) to AUD 103,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"8\">\r\n<li><strong>Production or Plant Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> A production and plant engineer works in a management and supervisory position for the manufacturing plant operations. They work on the construction of a new product and do plant functions to ensure quality. The plant manager maintains the facilities of quality control, design, logistics, and maintenance of the product standards.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 76,000 (Initially) to AUD 110,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"9\">\r\n<li><strong>Civil Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> The initial responsibilities of a civil engineer are to do plan, design, managing construction projects and other repairing jobs in construction. They do analysis, survey, and complete the activities with professional architectures. Civil engineers do model work on various building industries and also for government development businesses and workshops.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 76,000 (Initially) to AUD 110,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<ol start=\"10\">\r\n<li><strong>Mechanical Engineer</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>Job Context:</strong> A mechanical engineer engages in various communication duties, like developing, making, designing, and testing new or existing mechanical devices. Based on multiple projects, they have an essential role in using their skills to perform manufacturing equipment and industry-related technical missions.</p>\r\n<p>The Approximately salary ranges (Yearly): AUD 77,000 (Initially) to AUD 108,000 (For late-career).</p>\r\n<p>Conclusion:</p>\r\n<p>Nothing is easy to achieve in the job sector, and you can\'t even jump into the highest-paid job without having zero experience. Now all you need to know is which position you are capable of and can bloom your career. From the upper discussion, you will learn about some best-paid job categories in the Engineering sectors. In Australia, those are the highest-paid work for an engineering background.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'two-colleagues-factory_60c73c7eed912.jpg', 'WhatsApp Image 2021-06-14 at 5.18.56 PM_60c73c7eed912.jpg', 1, '2021-06-14 03:24:47', '2021-06-14 03:24:47');
INSERT INTO `blogs` (`id`, `action_user`, `blog_categories_id`, `blog_title`, `blog_slug`, `blog_des`, `meta_des`, `meta_tags`, `meta_keys`, `thumbnailOne`, `thumbnailTwo`, `isPublished`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(14, 1, 4, 'Get to know how an RPL assessment works that can build a bright future in Australia', 'get-to-know-how-an-rpl-assessment-works-that-can-build-a-bright-future-in-australia', '<p>If you are thinking of making outstanding growth in your career into a suitable sector, several options are available in Australia. So, let\'s make it easier for you to understand to build your most secure and relievable future in Australia. One of the best and easiest methods is getting an RPL certificate through your qualifications and performed skills based on your eligibility. From an assessment program of RPL, anyone can make a possible career without any degree or educational certificate.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>But the fact is most of them don\'t have much idea about how to do the valuation to get an RPL certificate. So many of them afraid to apply for a certificate assessment program and fail to get a good job in Australia. With all that issues, we will have a brief discussion on how to make the assessment in the RPL program and build a bright future through RPL. Along with that, let\'s talk about some quarries and questionaries on RPL/skills assessment tools in Australia.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>What is an RPL assessment program?&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As we know, the Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) program is an assessment training program based on skills, qualifications, and working experiences. Let\'s say, for example, RPL is a total package system for an experienced worker, and it gives the most possibilities chance to have a great deal in the Australian job market.</p>\r\n<p>Anyone can apply for this RPL assessment if he/she is eligible and have legit working experience or knowledge in real life.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>What are the requirements needed for the RPL assessment tests?&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Before applying for an RPL certification test, you must know the requirements of what is vital for getting an RPL. Several zones are available to submit an RPL. Now the choice is where you can put yourself in this skills assessment test.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Make sure to provide the required and relevant paper files that are mentioned in the individual form.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Specified working experience, and proven documents (Based on which sector you want to earn the RPL)&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Now compiling to submit your best portfolio such as previous qualifications, any bachelor or relevant degree (If any), job references, work-line photos, and videos, and most importantly, your updated resume, etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The recommendation letter of an authorized agent and all the government-certified attached files.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>All those requirements are important to pass the assessment tests, but some other documents can be required if necessary.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>How to apply the skill assessment and training for the RPL certificates?&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>At first, you need to decide in which sector you want to develop your work line. Next, collect all the necessary papers and documents to fill up the RPL assessment form. After Submitting all the papers, it will take more or less seven working days for checking up by the certified agents or representative.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>When the evolution is done, the evaluator ensures all the components that are important regarding an applicant\'s information. If there are any quarries, then the RPL form is sent back to the candidate to make the correction carefully. After the correction, again, the form needs to resubmit. Next, there is a recognition interview arrange for each candidate.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>After evaluating all the compile records, RTO arranges for a face-to-face or an online introduction season for the students at a suitable time and date. Sometimes participants need to go through a written test too. Following the process, all the steps need to pass, and some authorities may ask for a final interview when you got the result and become eligible for the right owner of an RPL. The institution where you applied will give a terminal confirmation letter to the agent. It takes two weeks to get the hard copy and collect it from the agent from where you do the process.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong>&nbsp;The certified student agents of Australia lead all the administrative support for paper enrolment, payment, other recommendations (if required), quarry of certificates and statements, and further updates.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>How to progress an RPL qualification step by step?&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Depending on your prior learning and previous working involvement, you can pick up an appointment for an RPL certificate. For 1/2 years, an experienced candidate will be eligible to get Diploma-level certificates, and if you have more sustainable qualifications, you can apply for the RPL certificates II, III. There are other considerations to update the level of your certificate to the professional level.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Usually, those certificates are provided by evaluating candidates\' skills and knowledge; that\'s why clients need to have more reviewing evidence and updated portfolios. The currency and payment may also vary the situation, and it will give some proficiency on RPL assessment certificates. Some other qualifications greatly influence getting advanced RPL certificates, like no criminal records, natural job experience, volunteer works, and formal and informal skill training. Demonstration of the knowledge and skills will build up a good impression of the RTO institution and allow you to step forward for the RPL assessment. There is no traditional system of study to make any progression to get an RPL, and you need to focus on the presentation of your file.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>From the ITEC Aus, you will get the best and most proper consultation on updating your portfolio and making progress in Australia\'s career.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Last words&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>You will always find out some tricky benefits and long-term working facilities of an RPL assessment program. With all the purposes of the skill assessment, nothing is up to the loss, but you will get more and more confident to apply those terms in the job life. In this article, every major quarry on RPL have been presented and given possible solution for all the questionaries. Now ITEC Aus (International Training &amp; Educational Counsel, Australia) is one of Australia\'s iconic and most successful counsel Center. They always ready to provide you with the best RPL services and maintain an easier process for all the categories of RPL assessment within your best price. So, click and visit our RPL section for a clearer vision of RPL assessment.</p>', 'You will always find out some tricky benefits and long-term working facilities of an RPL assessment program. With all the purposes of the skill assessment, nothing is up to the loss, but you will get more and more confident to apply those terms in the job life. In this article.', 'RPL assessment works', 'RPL assessment works', 'successful-happy-business-team 2_60c97fc325949.jpg', 'WhatsApp Image 2021-06-15 at 6.24.37 PM (1)_60c97fc325949.jpg', 1, '2021-06-15 20:36:19', '2021-06-15 20:48:27');

